      structure: ["Top bar: product name, four text links with the active one marked, a Sign in link and a primary Start free button.", "A centred heading block: a small Pricing badge, a very large headline, one muted line and a Monthly / Yearly switch.", "Three plan cards in a row: plan name, price in a large monospace figure, a one-line description, a bulleted feature list and a full-width button. The middle card is filled with the primary colour and carries a Most popular badge.", "Below, two equal cards: a Compare table (feature, then one column per plan) and a Questions list where each row ends in a plus sign."],
