      structure: ["Top bar: product name, four text links with Board active, three overlapping initials avatars and a primary New task button.", "Page header: sprint name and days left in muted text, the board title, an Everyone / Mine switch and an outlined Filter button.", "Four columns (To do, In progress, In review, Done), each with a heading and a count badge. Task cards stack under each heading: a coloured type badge (Design, Build, Copy or Bug), the task title in bold, a thin progress bar when work has started, and a bottom row with the owner's initials avatar and the due date in the monospace font.", "The first column ends with a full-width outlined Add a task button."],
