      structure: ["Top bar: product name, three text links, a shortened wallet address and a primary button.", "Left, the 3D stage: one tall collectible card turned toward the viewer in perspective. Its face is a bright blend of the three brand colours with a shaded sphere as the artwork, a diagonal streak of light across it, and a footer with the piece name and edition number. It casts a deep soft shadow.", "Right: a collection badge, the piece name as a very large heading, a one-line description, then three stat cards (top bid, floor, time left).", "Under them a bid form (amount field, balance line, full-width primary button) and a Bids card listing bidder, time and amount in the monospace font."],
