      structure: ["Top bar: product name, four text links, a Sign in link and a primary button.", "Left: a small badge, a very large headline, a muted paragraph, and a card listing the four layers. Each row has a numbered coloured square, the layer name, a one-line job and its layer number on the right.", "Right, the 3D stage: four square plates stacked in isometric view with a gap between them, each a different brand colour with a darker edge underneath so it reads as a thick slab. The top plate is the first layer in the list.", "The colours of the plates match the numbered squares in the list."],
